w board (“IRB”) approval to conduct a clinical trial at a prospective site;","context":"· delay or failure to reach agreement on acceptable clinical trial agreement terms or clinical trial protocols with prospective sites or clinical research organizations (“CROs”), the terms of which can be subject to extensive negotiation and may vary significantly among different sites or CROs;","section":"ITEM 1A. RISK FACTORS","block":172,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001683168-26-002026","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-19","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001759186","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759186/000168316826002026/coeptis_i10k-123125.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/64a70377777e0289c142aeee3b28199fce5496f32037aed0205fef36ac43d37d.bin","sha256":"64a70377777e0289c142aeee3b28199fce5496f32037aed0205fef36ac43d37d"}},{"id":"180bf4f105f17600ee6ee8c1ce2bf75f45e6f5acf8b24ed6cca67f2df8c11e2b","quote":"· slower than expected rates of patient recruitment and enrollment;","context":"· delay or failure to obtain institutional review board (“IRB”) approval to conduct a clinical trial at a prospective site;","section":"ITEM 1A. RISK FACTORS","block":173,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001683168-26-002026","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-19","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001759186","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759186/000168316826002026/coeptis_i10k-123125.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/64a70377777e0289c142aeee3b28199fce5496f32037aed0205fef36ac43d37d.bin","sha256":"64a70377777e0289c142aeee3b28199fce5496f32037aed0205fef36ac43d37d"}},{"id":"dabfc12a05af8405f6396579e0238a734f86f24649e5375be43ce11de2647fdd","quote":"· failure of patients to complete the clinical trial;","context":"· slower than expected rates of patient recruitment and enrollment;","section":"ITEM 1A. RISK FACTORS","block":174,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001683168-26-002026","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-19","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001759186","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759186/000168316826002026/coeptis_i10k-123125.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/64a70377777e0289c142aeee3b28199fce5496f32037aed0205fef36ac43d37d.bin","sha256":"64a70377777e0289c142aeee3b28199fce5496f32037aed0205fef36ac43d37d"}},{"id":"2f34e8729918844e83ba3fc5e6d7084cf4706d06039380a3bd6fbfb6789b95a2","quote":"· the inability to enroll a sufficient number of patients in studies to ensure adequate statistical power to detect statistically significant treatment effects;","context":"· failure of patients to complete the clinical trial;","section":"ITEM 1A. RISK FACTORS","block":175,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001683168-26-002026","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-19","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001759186","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759186/000168316826002026/coeptis_i10k-123125.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/64a70377777e0289c142aeee3b28199fce5496f32037aed0205fef36ac43d37d.bin","sha256":"64a70377777e0289c142aeee3b28199fce5496f32037aed0205fef36ac43d37d"}},{"id":"911b55a9a7c2ecde83ed37e03441da8533a89a85ff303a572543177e5229b070","quote":"· unforeseen safety issues, including severe or unexpected drug-related adverse effects experienced by patients, including possible deaths;","context":"· the inability to enroll a sufficient number of patients in studies to ensure adequate statistical power to detect statistically significant treatment effects;","section":"ITEM 1A. RISK FACTORS","block":176,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001683168-26-002026","form":"10-K","fil